# Flavors of Our Lives (adoulin 46), the first offer's options: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin. Berghent: 80,
# finished on 2: refused (any option but 1: the local var 1); 81. A zone change clears the local var: 80, finished on 1:
# begun (80's option 1 arm). Prog 0: 82.
lists WesternAdoulin/Berghent/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/80 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/81
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=97.221,-0.148,-28.68 job=WAR lvl=99
login
trigger Berghent                        # available, no refusal: 80
finish option=2                         # not option 1: refused (Flavors_of_Our_Lives_Refused 1)
trigger Berghent                        # refused before: 81
finish option=0                         # nothing
warp -316.5,-1,-318 RalaWaterways
warp 97.221,-0.148,-28.68 WesternAdoulin
trigger Berghent                        # the local var gone with the zone: 80
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Berghent                        # Prog 0: 82
finish
